      "prompt": "In the reaction Zn(s) + Cu²⁺(aq) → Zn²⁺(aq) + Cu(s), trace the electron flow.\n\nWrite two equations:\n1. Identify which species gains electrons (reduction). Show exactly how many electrons this atom/ion acquires to reach its final state.\n2. Write the corresponding oxidation equation showing electron loss from Zinc.",
